Q3. What are the advantages
of the Decorator Pattern?

Interview Ready Answer

Advantages

• Adds new functionality
  at runtime.

• Does not modify
  existing classes.

• Follows the
  Open/Closed Principle.

• Avoids the
  Subclass Explosion Problem.

• Improves Code Reusability.

• Allows flexible
  feature combinations.

• Improves Maintainability.

------------------------------------------------------------

Why is it preferred
over Inheritance?

Inheritance creates
many subclasses
for different feature combinations.

Decorator wraps
the existing object
and adds only
the required features.

------------------------------------------------------------

Example

Instead of creating

MilkCoffee

